<https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "FunctionCall" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Invocation of a function in a pipeline. Can reference a defined Function by name, OR inline a callable directly for external library functions, OR inline an equation, OR use class_call for class instantiation. Mirrors Function attributes so pipeline steps can be self-contained. The `name` is an optional step label (used in pipelines for keyed access to step outputs); it is NOT a global identifier (singleton uses like `loss`, `observable` may omit it)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/FunctionCall> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
