<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/SoftwareRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An individual software requirement binding a package to a version constraint and a role within an environment." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/SoftwareRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/software> .
