<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/SoftwareRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Represents an individual requirement (package/module/library)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/SoftwareRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Use 'version_spec' instead of 'version' for semantic clarity." .
