<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/exhibitsBifurcation> _:genid2499 .
_:genid2499 <https://w3id.org/tvbo/bifurcationType> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Hopf> .
_:genid2499 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/BifurcationEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/exhibitsRegime> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Oscillatory> .
