<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/I> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/J> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/alpha> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/cr> .
