<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "JansenRit" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jansen-Rit"@en .
