<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/parameters/b> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/parameters/d> .
