<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/parameters/tau_s> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/parameters/w> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasStateVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/model_type> "mean_field" .
