<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/derived_variables/r_I> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Inhibitory population firing rate (sigmoid stand-in for aLN Phi)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/derived_variables/r_I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r_I (CakanObermayer derived variable)" .
