<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/derived_variables/r_I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "r_I" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/derived_variables/r_I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "r_max/(1 + exp(-k_phi*(mu_si - mu_th)))" .
