<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V_e (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V_e, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I_e + V_e**2 + eta_e - pi**2*r_e**2*tau_e**2 + s_ee*tau_e - s_ei*tau_e)/tau_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
