<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V_i (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V_i, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I_i + V_i**2 + eta_i - pi**2*r_i**2*tau_i**2 + s_ie*tau_i - s_ii*tau_i)/tau_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r_e (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r_e, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Delta_e/(pi*tau_e) + 2*V_e*r_e)/tau_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
