<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Iext> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "External input current to the first state-variable x_E2D, in Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Iext> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "3.1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Iext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Iext (Epileptor2D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Iext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "External input current to the first state-variable x_E2D, in Epileptor2D (Proix et al.,2014)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Iext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Iext" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Permittivity coupling on the slow permittivity state-variable z_E2D in Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
