<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/modification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "modification (Epileptor2D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/modification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When modification is True, the function h_E2D uses a nonlinear influence on z_E2D. The default value is False, i.e., linear influence on z_E2D." .
