<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Temporal scaling in the slow state-variable, \\\n        called :math:`1\\tau_{0}` in Jirsa paper (see class Epileptor)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .
