<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/slope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/slope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Linear coefficient in the first state-variable x_E2D via the function f_E2D, in Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
