# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Epileptogenicity Parameter" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "-1.6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x0 (Epileptor5D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Epileptogenicity Parameter. Degree of excitability or epileptogenicity in Epileptor5D (Jirsa et al.,2014).\n\nIf x0 is greater than a critical value, x0,critic = −2.05, the system can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state.\n\nNote:\n- If modification_E5D:\nif x0 is smaller than a critical value, x0,critic = 2.91, can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (Proix et al., 2014)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "g_E5D is a low-pass filtered excitatory coupling function from sub-population (x1_E5D, y1_E5D) to (x2_E5D, y2_E5D) in Epileptor5D (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "g (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "g" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(g, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-0.01*g + 0.001*x1)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state-variable of the first Epileptor5D population (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1 (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(Iext + Kvf*c_pop0 + local_coupling*x1 + x1*x1cond + y1 - z)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state-variable of the second Epileptor5D sub-population (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x2 (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x2, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(Iext2 + Kf*c_pop1 + bb*g - x2**3 + x2 - y2 - 0.3*z + 1.05)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state-variable of the first Epileptor5D sub-population (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y1 (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(c - d*x1**2 - y1)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state-variable of the second Epileptor5D population (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y2 (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y2, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/y2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-y2 + y2cond)/tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity state-variable of the Epileptor5D (Jirsa et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "z (Epileptor5D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "z" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "r*tt*(Ks*c_pop0 + h - z)" .
