<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/y2cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "y2cond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/y2cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0.0, x2 < -0.25), (aa*(x2 + 0.25), True))" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "zcond (EpileptorRestingState derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "zcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "zcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((-0.1*z**7, z < 0), (0.0, True))" .
