<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/f
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Coefficient of the cubic term of the cubic nullcline" .
