<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mean excitatory external input to the derivative of the state-variable y4_JR (PCs) represented by a pulse density, that consists of activity originating from adjacent and more distant cortical columns, as well as from subcortical structures (e.g., thalamus)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "mu" .
