<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/minf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/minf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "minf (KIonEx derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/minf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "minf" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/minf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "minf" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/minf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "1.0/(exp((Cmna - V)/DCmna) + 1.0)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ninf (KIonEx derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ninf" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "ninf" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/ninf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "1.0/(exp((Cnk - V)/DCnk) + 1.0)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/r
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
