# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "xcond (KIonEx derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "xcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "xcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/xcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((Delta - J*r*x + 2*R_minus*x*(V - c_minus), V <= Vstar), (Delta - J*r*x + 2*R_plus*x*(V - c_plus), True))" .
