# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average firing rate of the population of IINs, Z." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Q_Z (LarterBreakspear derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Q_Z" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Q_Z" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/Q_Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "0.5*Q_Zmax*(tanh((Z - Z_T)/delta_Z) + 1)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "lc_0 (LarterBreakspear derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "lc_0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "lc_0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/lc_0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Q_V*local_coupling" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Fraction of open calcium channels (Breakspear et al., 2003b). \n\nDescribes relationship between membrane voltage and channel conductance." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005262> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "m_Ca (LarterBreakspear derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "m_Ca" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "m_Ca" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Ca> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "0.5*tanh((-T_Ca + V)/delta_Ca) + 0.5" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
