<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005267> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "m_K (LarterBreakspear derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "m_K" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "m_K" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_K> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "0.5*tanh((-T_K + V)/delta_K) + 0.5" .
