<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Na> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "m_Na (LarterBreakspear derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/derived_variables/m_Na> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "m_Na" .
