<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state-variable of the Larter-Breakspear (Breakspear et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V (LarterBreakspear state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "t_scale*(I_ext*a_ne - Q_Z*Z*a_ie - W*g_K*(V - V_K) - g_L*(V - V_L) + m_Ca*(V - V_Ca)*(-C*a_ee*c_pop0*r_NMDA - a_ee*r_NMDA*(1.0 - C)*(Q_V + lc_0) - g_Ca) - (V - V_Na)*(C*a_ee*c_pop0 + a_ee*(1.0 - C)*(Q_V + lc_0) + g_Na*m_Na))" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state-variable of the Larter-Breakspear (Breakspear et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005267> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "W (LarterBreakspear state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "W" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(W, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/W> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "phi*t_scale*(-W + m_K)/tau_K" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
