<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Z (LarterBreakspear state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Z" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(Z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "b*t_scale*(I_ext*a_ni + Q_V*V*a_ei)" .
