<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I + J*r*tau + V**2 + c_pop0*cr*tau + c_pop1*cv + eta - pi**2*r**2*tau**2)/tau" .
