<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Delta/(pi*tau) + 2*V*r)/tau" .
