# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
