<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid input-output function of the synaptic input current, x_RWW, that computes the averaged firing rate of the neurons population (Deco et al., 2013)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "H (ReducedWongWang derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "H" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(a*x - b)/(1 - exp(-d*(a*x - b)))" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "(NMDAR)-mediated synaptic input current to the neurons population (Deco et al., 2013)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x (ReducedWongWang derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "I_o + J_N*S*local_coupling + J_N*S*w + J_N*c_pop0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/parameters/I_o
