<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "State-variable of the Reduced WongWang model, denoting the average, (NMDAR)-mediated synaptic gating, i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "S (ReducedWongWang state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "S" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(S, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/state_variables/S> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "H*gamma*(1 - S) - S/tau_s" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid function that computes the averaged firing rate of the excitatory neuron population IE_RWW_EI (Deco et al., 2014; Abbott & Chance, 2005)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "H_e (ReducedWongWangExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "H_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x_e/(1 - exp(-d_e*x_e))" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
