<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid function that computes the averaged firing rate of the inhibitory neuron population II_RWW (Deco et al., 2014; Abbott & Chance, 2005)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "H_i (ReducedWongWangExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "H_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x_i/(1 - exp(-d_i*x_i))" .
# 
