<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coupling (ReducedWongWangExcInh derived variable)" .
