<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "coupling" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "G*J_N*(S_e*local_coupling + c_glob)" .
