<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "a_e*(I_ext + I_o*W_e + J_N_S_e*w_p - J_i*S_i + coupling) - b_e" .
