<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Timescale separation between fast (xi, alpha) and slow (eta, beta) variables." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Inhibitory fast variable (per mode)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "alpha (StefanescuJirsa2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "alpha" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(alpha, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tau*(alpha - f_i*alpha**3/3 - beta) + K21*(Cik*xi - alpha) + tau*(II_i + c_pop0 + local_coupling*xi)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Inhibitory slow recovery variable (per mode)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "beta (StefanescuJirsa2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "beta" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(beta, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/beta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(alpha - b*beta + n_i)/tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
