<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "eta (StefanescuJirsa2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "eta" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(eta, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/eta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(xi - b*eta + m_i)/tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/xi
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
