<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "xi (StefanescuJirsa2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "xi" .
