<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/xi> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tau*(xi - e_i*xi**3/3 - eta) + K11*(Aik*xi - xi) - K12*(Bik*alpha - xi) + tau*(IE_i + c_pop0 + local_coupling*xi)" .
