<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa3D/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "beta - e_i*alpha**3 + f_i*alpha**2 - gamma + K_21*(C_ik*xi - alpha) + II_i + c_pop0 + local_coupling*xi" .
# 
