<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/parameters/omega> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Angular frequency" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/parameters/omega> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/parameters/omega> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "omega (SupHopf parameter)" .
