# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state-variable of the Supercritical Hopf model" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x (SupHopf state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "c_pop0 + lc_0 - omega*y + x*(a - x**2 - y**2)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state-variable of the Supercritical Hopf model" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y (SupHopf state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "c_pop1 + omega*x + y*(a - x**2 - y**2)" .
# 
