# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic coupling strength" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "3.07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "J (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/J> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "J" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Baseline release probability" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "U0 (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/U0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "U0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Softplus nonlinearity steepness (smoothed threshold gain)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "alpha (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/alpha> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "alpha" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Membrane time constant (firing rate relaxation)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.013"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tau (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic depression recovery time constant" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tauD (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tauD" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic facilitation decay time constant" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tauF (TsodyksMarkram parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/parameters/tauF> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tauF" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Mean firing rate of the excitatory population" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "E" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(E, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-E + SS1)/tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic facilitation variable (release probability). Decays to U0 with time constant tauF and is enhanced proportionally to firing." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "u (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "u" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(u, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(U0 - u)/tauF + U0*(1 - u)*E" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic depression variable (fraction of available neurotransmitter). Recovers to 1 with time constant tauD and is depleted proportionally to firing." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(1 - x)/tauD - u*x*E" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "lc_0 (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "lc_0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "lc_0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "local_coupling*E" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "lc_1 (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "lc_1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "lc_1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/lc_1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "I*local_coupling" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_e (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "s_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "c_e/(1.0 + exp(-a_e*(-b_e + x_e))) - 1.0*shift_sigmoid/(exp(a_e*b_e) + 1.0)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_i (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "s_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "c_i/(1.0 + exp(-a_i*(-b_i + x_i))) - 1.0*shift_sigmoid/(exp(a_i*b_i) + 1.0)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average level of excitation in excitatory neuron at time t. Can be interpreted as membrane potential (Sanz-Leon et al., 2015)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x_e (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "alpha_e*(-I*c_ei + P + c_ee*E + c_pop0 + lc_0 + lc_1 - theta_e)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average level of excitation in inhibitory neuron at time t. Can be interpreted as membrane potential. (Sanz-Leon et al., 2015)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x_i (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "alpha_i*(-I*c_ii + Q + c_ie*E + lc_0 + lc_1 - theta_i)" .
