# https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/EI_Tuning_FIC_EIB_Optimization
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/EI_Tuning_FIC_EIB_Optimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/EI_Tuning_FIC_EIB_Optimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SimulationExperiment> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/EI_Tuning_FIC_EIB_Optimization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Fitting functional connectivity using the two-population Reduced Wong-Wang model with explicit excitatory and inhibitory populations. Combines Feedback Inhibition Control (FIC) to maintain local E-I balance with EIB tuning to globally optimize network connectivity. Supports both iterative (FIC+EIB) and gradient-based optimization approaches.\n" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/EI_Tuning_FIC_EIB_Optimization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EI Tuning: Functional Connectivity Fitting" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/JR_MEG_FrequencyGradient_Optimization
